WEBVTT

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:22.020
Huh? Kanata, are you going home?

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:24.800
You're not waiting for Yuki-kun?

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:25.980
I'll be back.

00:00:28.990 --> 00:00:30.320
Welcome home, Yuki.

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:31.480
I'm back.

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:34.160
Kanata-san!

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:35.810
Welcome home.

00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:38.200
Here's the book you asked about.

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:42.460
Were you waiting long?

00:00:42.460 --> 00:00:44.340
I just happened to be in the area.

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:46.920
Why don't you stay a while longer?

00:00:47.410 --> 00:00:51.480
No, I wouldn't want to interfere
with your studies.

00:00:52.890 --> 00:00:54.400
I'll see you later.

00:00:56.670 --> 00:00:57.800
Kanata-san!

00:01:00.940 --> 00:01:01.690
Take this.

00:01:01.690 --> 00:01:04.010
It's really cold today.

00:01:09.350 --> 00:01:10.890
It's snowing.

00:01:13.030 --> 00:01:14.370
It really is.

00:01:14.890 --> 00:01:17.840
A student preparing for entrance exams
shouldn't be out in the cold.

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:20.200
You should go inside.

00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:21.270
Okay.

00:01:26.570 --> 00:01:29.910
Kanata-san, make sure you
don't catch a cold, either.

00:01:31.530 --> 00:01:33.050
Soon, it will be spring.

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:37.340
Then you'll be a high school student, Yuki.

00:01:38.170 --> 00:01:39.640
I look forward to the
conversations we'll have,

00:01:39.640 --> 00:01:43.130
standing under the cherry blossoms,

00:01:43.130 --> 00:01:47.190
with the director and these children.

00:01:47.190 --> 00:01:51.410
During the summer, we
can go to the beach.

00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:57.280
We'll have barbecues and
go camping together.

00:01:57.280 --> 00:02:00.170
And we'll bring fireworks, too.

00:02:00.170 --> 00:02:00.870
Yeah.

00:02:06.450 --> 00:02:08.590
You should go inside.

00:02:09.030 --> 00:02:10.880
I'll see you later.

00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:14.600
Let's go inside, everyone!

00:02:14.600 --> 00:02:16.120
Okay!

00:02:27.300 --> 00:02:30.690
Only I know your pain...

00:02:31.610 --> 00:02:32.910
Your uncertainty...

00:02:33.950 --> 00:02:36.130
Your loneliness...

00:02:37.240 --> 00:02:41.430
If only we could be together forever.

00:02:42.980 --> 00:02:47.670
I'll say it as many times as you wish.

00:02:55.830 --> 00:02:57.930
I will not betray you!

00:04:42.820 --> 00:04:44.050
Is that...

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:45.930
The barrier fell!

00:05:00.560 --> 00:05:01.910
Kanata-san...

00:05:13.890 --> 00:05:18.890
The Indelible Image

00:05:18.890 --> 00:05:20.140
Yuki?

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:23.730
Kanata... Is he...

00:05:23.730 --> 00:05:25.190
Yes.

00:05:25.890 --> 00:05:27.610
He's Giou Reiga.

00:05:28.900 --> 00:05:31.860
That's right, he's...

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:35.310
He's not Kanata-san.

00:05:43.120 --> 00:05:44.840
Withdraw, Cadenza.

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:47.870
I will not allow you to keep
doing as you wish.

00:05:47.870 --> 00:05:52.470
In that case, do you mean to
complete the job yourself?

00:05:55.400 --> 00:05:57.710
It was not your order,

00:05:58.500 --> 00:06:02.730
but we will have to destroy
God's Light eventually.

00:06:02.730 --> 00:06:06.730
Why do you insist on protecting him?

00:06:06.730 --> 00:06:09.980
Protecting me?

00:06:11.070 --> 00:06:14.190
Did you not hear me, Cadenza?

00:06:14.780 --> 00:06:15.900
Withdraw!

00:06:26.920 --> 00:06:28.090
Chains?

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:31.250
They're the summoner's bonds.

00:06:31.250 --> 00:06:32.420
Bonds?

00:06:33.040 --> 00:06:37.430
The necromancer's words compel
a summoned Duras to obey.

00:06:37.980 --> 00:06:41.930
A Duras who disobeys his master
is bound by chains...

00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:44.290
And burned.

00:06:52.320 --> 00:06:56.260
But why is Reiga stopping Cadenza?

00:06:56.840 --> 00:06:59.220
Shouldn't they want the same thing?

00:06:59.870 --> 00:07:01.100
Yes.

00:07:01.820 --> 00:07:04.870
It seems our enemies are not united.

00:07:27.330 --> 00:07:28.600
Takashiro-sama!

00:07:29.260 --> 00:07:30.350
Don't touch me!

00:07:30.610 --> 00:07:33.900
This is the power of the stain...

00:07:33.900 --> 00:07:36.530
I don't want to expose you.

00:07:38.480 --> 00:07:39.990
Takashiro-sama...

00:07:43.620 --> 00:07:47.570
They must resent me.

00:07:54.840 --> 00:07:58.890
Give me some more time.

00:08:01.730 --> 00:08:05.520
We will have our revenge.

00:08:17.550 --> 00:08:18.380
Hotsuma!

00:08:18.380 --> 00:08:22.200
I know. Something doesn't feel right.

00:08:22.910 --> 00:08:24.220
Hotsu!

00:08:24.830 --> 00:08:27.000
We've been waiting for you.

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:28.780
Tachibana-san.

00:08:28.780 --> 00:08:30.950
What's going on?

00:08:30.950 --> 00:08:32.750
Is Yuki all right?

00:08:32.750 --> 00:08:35.800
Yuki's gone...

00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:37.590
What?

00:08:37.590 --> 00:08:40.260
Sen-kun and his partner
are out looking for him.

00:08:40.260 --> 00:08:43.460
Toko-kun and her partner are probably
searching with Luka-kun, too.

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:45.200
Shusei, let's go!

00:08:45.200 --> 00:08:46.120
Right.

00:08:46.120 --> 00:08:49.310
Go where? Do you know where to find him?

00:08:49.310 --> 00:08:52.860
There's an area where powers are clashing.

00:08:52.860 --> 00:08:54.350
Yuki must be there.

00:08:54.350 --> 00:08:55.660
Exactly.

00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:56.900
Shusei, let's go!

00:08:56.900 --> 00:08:57.730
Yes.

00:09:00.350 --> 00:09:02.290
We should make preparations, as well.

00:09:02.290 --> 00:09:04.510
We'll be receiving orders
from the boss soon.

00:09:04.510 --> 00:09:06.100
That's true.

00:09:10.790 --> 00:09:13.460
Tsukumo, can you hear Yuki-chan's voice?

00:09:14.030 --> 00:09:18.260
It's muddled. Something must
have shaken him up.

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:20.170
Yuki...

00:09:32.110 --> 00:09:37.600
Kanata-san, have you been protecting me?

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:44.220
You know what happens
when you disobey me.

00:09:48.050 --> 00:09:49.180
Yes.

00:09:49.180 --> 00:09:52.620
But that assumes

00:09:52.620 --> 00:09:57.790
that you are stronger than I am!

00:09:58.290 --> 00:10:00.370
Does he think he can force his way free?

00:10:03.010 --> 00:10:04.620
That's right...

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:08.260
You're also known as the "Master Killer."

00:10:09.610 --> 00:10:12.230
Kneel, Cadenza!

00:10:21.030 --> 00:10:26.180
You currently maintain control
over two General Classes.

00:10:26.700 --> 00:10:30.090
Your powers must be divided.

00:10:30.700 --> 00:10:33.620
A necromancer in such a weakened state...

00:10:35.450 --> 00:10:37.540
is nothing to fear!

00:11:16.420 --> 00:11:19.140
If you refuse to do it,

00:11:19.140 --> 00:11:23.670
I will kill God's Light!

00:11:29.920 --> 00:11:33.650
This is what's wrong with General Classes.

00:11:43.270 --> 00:11:44.440
<i>Izabud!</i>

00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:55.090
I can't believe it.

00:11:55.090 --> 00:11:58.960
Are they really trying to kill each other?

00:11:58.960 --> 00:12:00.690
Looks like it.

00:12:01.280 --> 00:12:04.550
A summoned Duras will always attempt
to overthrow its master.

00:12:05.230 --> 00:12:08.010
I've heard it's part of the
risk a summoner takes.

00:12:09.840 --> 00:12:14.020
Rather than fighting to subdue Cadenza,

00:12:14.020 --> 00:12:16.790
Reiga appears to be fighting
to protect Yuki.

00:12:17.360 --> 00:12:18.490
Why?

00:12:19.180 --> 00:12:23.330
This man isn't Kanata-san anymore...

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:28.290
Why?

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:34.850
<i>The hammer of judgment
will fall on the foolish.</i>

00:12:34.850 --> 00:12:37.290
<i>Dominion Sclaim!</i>

00:12:42.040 --> 00:12:43.310
<i>Lufen!</i>

00:12:44.380 --> 00:12:47.520
<i>I am the keeper of
the Key of Raziel.</i>

00:12:47.520 --> 00:12:49.650
<i>I invoke my title of necromancer</i>

00:12:49.650 --> 00:12:52.110
<i>to banish you to whence you came!</i>

00:12:52.110 --> 00:12:55.150
Does he intend to return
Cadenza to Infernus?

00:12:58.120 --> 00:13:00.300
He'll attack before he finishes the spell.

00:13:00.690 --> 00:13:04.240
He has no chance against Reiga
in a straight-up fight.

00:13:04.240 --> 00:13:06.150
Cadenza will engage him in close quarters,

00:13:06.150 --> 00:13:09.380
to prevent Reiga from casting
any powerful spells.

00:13:10.860 --> 00:13:15.100
<i>Black soul, black earth.</i>

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:18.330
<i>Bloodstained ground at
the edge of darkness.</i>

00:13:18.800 --> 00:13:23.520
<i>I call on the power of the Black King,
as granted by our blood pact.</i>

00:13:23.520 --> 00:13:25.330
<i>Forgiveness and vengeance.</i>

00:13:25.330 --> 00:13:27.330
<i>Trust and betrayal.</i>

00:13:27.330 --> 00:13:31.760
<i>Your body will know the
weight of commitment.</i>

00:13:31.760 --> 00:13:36.380
<i>I shall use your power to return
those to where they belong.</i>

00:13:37.490 --> 00:13:39.780
<i>Return to where you belong.</i>

00:13:39.780 --> 00:13:41.100
You're out of time!

00:13:43.560 --> 00:13:44.640
Kanata-san!

00:13:56.670 --> 00:13:59.200
How long can you last?

00:14:07.180 --> 00:14:08.700
How pathetic.

00:14:09.250 --> 00:14:11.930
Is God's Light really so important to you?

00:14:14.470 --> 00:14:18.220
You were only mediocre, too.

00:14:19.310 --> 00:14:22.390
Die, Giou Reiga!

00:14:22.660 --> 00:14:23.440
Kanata-san!

00:14:33.510 --> 00:14:36.570
Die, Giou Reiga!

00:14:45.480 --> 00:14:46.620
What?

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:52.340
What is it, Shusei?

00:14:52.930 --> 00:14:55.470
Another great power has appeared.

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:57.180
Could it be?

00:14:57.860 --> 00:14:59.370
Yes, it must be.

00:15:00.060 --> 00:15:01.210
It's Luka.

00:15:25.060 --> 00:15:26.170
Luka!

00:15:30.040 --> 00:15:32.360
Are you all right, Yuki?

00:15:32.360 --> 00:15:33.890
Yes.

00:15:41.740 --> 00:15:42.430
Sodom!

00:15:44.060 --> 00:15:45.780
Protect Yuki.

00:15:52.920 --> 00:15:53.900
Sodom.

00:15:55.770 --> 00:15:58.400
I'm so sorry. Are you okay?

00:16:00.470 --> 00:16:03.490
Good to see you again, Bloody Cross.

00:16:03.490 --> 00:16:07.590
To think that I would have
another chance to fight you...

00:16:13.730 --> 00:16:15.260
You want to fight?

00:16:18.550 --> 00:16:20.910
Luka's power is increasing.

00:16:20.910 --> 00:16:23.260
Will he destroy everything again?

00:16:25.650 --> 00:16:26.390
Toko-chan!

00:16:26.390 --> 00:16:27.670
Are you okay?

00:16:27.670 --> 00:16:28.950
Yeah.

00:16:28.950 --> 00:16:30.910
I just tripped.

00:16:30.910 --> 00:16:31.960
Good.

00:16:32.540 --> 00:16:33.850
Tsukumo...

00:16:34.980 --> 00:16:36.230
Is this...

00:16:36.230 --> 00:16:37.110
Yes.

00:16:38.010 --> 00:16:40.480
Luka intends to fight with all his strength.

00:16:55.630 --> 00:16:57.840
This pressure is unbelievable.

00:16:57.840 --> 00:16:59.630
Is this Luka's true power?

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:02.460
Luka...

00:17:05.970 --> 00:17:08.910
Good, Bloody Cross.

00:17:09.660 --> 00:17:13.260
I suppose we should settle
things, once and for all.

00:17:13.260 --> 00:17:14.560
Don't be a fool!

00:17:14.980 --> 00:17:17.210
We're your true opponents!

00:17:17.980 --> 00:17:20.780
It appears you insist on dying first.

00:17:21.950 --> 00:17:24.430
Kuroto-kun, Senshiro-san...

00:17:25.520 --> 00:17:26.730
Yuki-chan!

00:17:29.010 --> 00:17:31.050
Toko-chan, Tsukumo-kun.

00:17:31.050 --> 00:17:33.250
I'm glad we made it in time.

00:17:33.250 --> 00:17:35.850
Take Yuki and run.

00:17:35.850 --> 00:17:36.460
What?

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:38.240
What are you talking about?

00:17:38.240 --> 00:17:40.860
Yeah, we'll fight with you.

00:17:40.860 --> 00:17:42.550
Protect Yuki.

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:47.260
Isn't that a Zweilt's responsibility?

00:17:50.330 --> 00:17:51.310
Luka.

00:17:52.310 --> 00:17:53.690
Go, Yuki.

00:17:54.470 --> 00:17:55.270
Luka...

00:17:56.180 --> 00:17:57.520
Don't worry.

00:17:58.610 --> 00:18:00.420
I won't let him die...

00:18:02.790 --> 00:18:04.860
If that's what you want.

00:18:07.750 --> 00:18:09.100
Let's go, Yuki-chan.

00:18:09.100 --> 00:18:10.270
Toko-chan.

00:18:10.900 --> 00:18:13.210
Kuroto, Senshiro-san.

00:18:13.210 --> 00:18:17.130
I understand how you must feel,
but let's do as Luka says.

00:18:20.390 --> 00:18:21.340
Fine.

00:18:23.570 --> 00:18:27.470
I don't understand you at all.

00:18:32.560 --> 00:18:34.850
I'll kill you all!

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:04.620
He protected us?

00:19:04.620 --> 00:19:07.800
That's absurd. He's Reiga!

00:19:07.800 --> 00:19:09.490
Kanata-san?

00:19:09.890 --> 00:19:14.350
Cadenza, I told you not to disobey me.

00:19:14.930 --> 00:19:18.350
I will not allow you to kill God's Light now.

00:19:25.050 --> 00:19:26.580
Let's go, Yuki-chan. We can-

00:19:26.580 --> 00:19:27.240
I can't go.

00:19:28.030 --> 00:19:29.910
Why, Kanata-san?

00:19:30.710 --> 00:19:33.200
Why are you protecting me?

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:37.320
Give it up, Yuki. He's Reiga.

00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:42.570
If you truly hate mankind and
have betrayed the Giou Clan,

00:19:42.570 --> 00:19:47.260
why throw yourself in harm's
way to protect me?

00:19:48.590 --> 00:19:53.600
You told me to hate you, but I can't.

00:19:54.740 --> 00:19:56.140
I can't!

00:19:57.540 --> 00:19:59.400
Fool.

00:19:59.400 --> 00:20:06.280
Do you not realize that keeping
you alive is a part of the plan?

00:20:06.280 --> 00:20:09.700
Don't think so highly of yourself.

00:20:09.700 --> 00:20:11.030
Kanata-san...

00:20:11.660 --> 00:20:15.520
I told you, I've abandoned the
name Wakamiya Kanata.

00:20:15.940 --> 00:20:17.440
You haven't.

00:20:18.780 --> 00:20:21.120
You were real.

00:20:21.120 --> 00:20:25.340
The time we spent together wasn't a lie.

00:20:27.230 --> 00:20:30.640
You said we would go see
the spring flowers.

00:20:31.840 --> 00:20:37.850
We'd go to the beach during the summer,
with the Asahi Orphanage children.

00:20:38.370 --> 00:20:42.130
We would have barbecues and go camping.

00:20:42.650 --> 00:20:44.930
We would set off fireworks.

00:20:45.860 --> 00:20:51.390
It wasn't that long ago, we
were laughing and talking!

00:20:52.910 --> 00:20:54.030
So, please...

00:20:54.520 --> 00:20:56.160
Please stop doing this!

00:20:58.090 --> 00:21:00.780
You're all full of nonsense.

00:21:01.780 --> 00:21:04.690
You sacrifice yourself to
protect the enemy.

00:21:04.690 --> 00:21:08.380
You cry for your enemy and
pray for reconciliation.

00:21:08.380 --> 00:21:10.800
I cannot possibly understand it.

00:21:14.230 --> 00:21:15.560
Reiga-dono,

00:21:15.560 --> 00:21:20.490
if keeping God's Light alive
is truly part of our plan,

00:21:20.490 --> 00:21:25.520
I apologize for my actions,
and I will continue to serve you.

00:21:26.870 --> 00:21:29.360
Tell me, Reiga-dono.

00:21:29.360 --> 00:21:31.860
Where do your loyalties lie?

00:21:33.680 --> 00:21:34.290
Depending on your answer-

00:21:34.290 --> 00:21:36.700
<i>Burn, darkness!</i>

00:21:38.720 --> 00:21:40.250
Another foe?

00:21:41.840 --> 00:21:44.290
Hotsuma-kun! Shusei-kun!

00:21:44.290 --> 00:21:45.400
Hotsuma...

00:21:46.030 --> 00:21:49.380
Looks like the whole gang's here.

00:21:50.180 --> 00:21:55.510
Yes, they're all unbelievably powerful.

00:23:35.850 --> 00:23:39.360
Hotsuma-kun, can you describe
Shusei-kun's appeal in a word?

00:23:39.360 --> 00:23:40.530
Where did that come from?

00:23:40.940 --> 00:23:44.100
There's no way I can describe
Shusei in a single word.

00:23:44.100 --> 00:23:45.930
Then, Shusei-kun, can you describe
Hotsuma-kun's appeal in a word?

00:23:45.930 --> 00:23:47.000
To the Final Battle...

00:23:47.000 --> 00:23:47.850
He's simple-minded.

00:23:47.850 --> 00:23:49.410
Yeah, that's right... Hey!

00:23:49.410 --> 00:23:49.930
To the Final Battle...
